  "entries": [
    "You supercool the nearby air, forming a cloud of dancing ice crystals in an emanation around you. A creature other than you that enters the area or ends its turn within the area takes 2d6 cold damage. A creature can take this damage only once per turn. The crystals scatter and refract light; if a light effect enters diamond dust's area, any creatures that effect goes on to affect gain a +2 status bonus to AC and saves against it.",
    "While the spell persists, you can activate or deactivate this aura by using a single action, which has the concentrate trait.",
    "You can Dismiss this spell."
